  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Ben, Mia, Sam, and Leo are at the playground. The sun is big and yellow. They are good friends. They play a hobby game. They sing a song. They like to play. Sam has a small hockey ball. Mia has a book about animals. Leo has a black hat.",
      "\"What is your hobby, friend?\" \"My hobby is hockey, hockey, hockey!\" \"What is your hobby, friend?\" \"My hobby is animals, animals, animals!\" \"What is your hobby, friend?\" \"My hobby is jumping, jumping, jumping!\" Sam runs with the ball. Mia points to a bird in her book. Ben jumps and jumps. Leo claps his hands. Mia smiles at Sam.",
      "\"What is your hobby, Leo?\" ask the friends. Leo puts on his black hat. \"I am a bat!\" he says. \"Bats can fly!\" Leo runs and runs. The friends clap and clap. He is a funny bat. \"My hobby is bat, bat, bat!\" The friends sing it again. It is a fun song!"
    ],
